cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If this research software informs your work, cite the repository URL and the exact Git commit
  you used. No archival software release or project paper has been published yet.
title: "CompactVIO-UAV: Camera and IMU recordings to inspectable local 3D trajectories"
type: software
authors:
  - name: CompactVIO-UAV contributors
repository-code: "https://github.com/laxman-kc/compact-vio-uav"
url: "https://github.com/laxman-kc/compact-vio-uav"
abstract: >-
  A compact hybrid visual-inertial odometry research pipeline that combines optical flow,
  gyro-derived rotation, and a learned translation head to generate inspectable local
  trajectories from synchronized monocular-camera and IMU recordings.
keywords:
  - visual-inertial odometry
  - robotics
  - optical flow
  - inertial measurement unit
  - trajectory estimation
